  "implementation_findings": [
    "Current own policy equals the accepted frozen hardware facts plus only the reviewed page-navigation additions. Every preexisting family policy object is unchanged; electrical policy changes only its digest.",
    "The native apply_l012 leaf precedes classic/cold paths. It validates own originals/member authority,50 native identities/addresses,166 complete controls,1466 fields,31 gate/reset/key/shared-group instances, requester/observer membership, source enums, independent electrical/HSI/RTC facts and packages before projection.",
    "Only exact C8T6/C8U6 receive the full LsiSysclk record and PB11 AF4 then PF3 AF2 existing Pin records. Both routes have absent optional muxes and are physically bonded at22 and44. Generic L012 receives neither. The existing PB11 scalar is a nonexhaustive compatibility anchor.",
    "The build predicate checks full PeripheralLsiSysclk equality, exact2 names/native version/line, no PLL, complete PeripheralPin tuple equality, core bonds and native field shapes. Existing sanitization is respected. The native early return prevents cold requester, separate AWT and singular-output generation.",
    "Raw SVD and curated IR permissions are compared independently. Raw KEY write-only fields in RW registers, unkeyed reset registers, four read-only STABLE overlays, IWDT OV raw RW versus operational RW0, and the existing ADC ISR Read override are retained. No register/access overlay was changed.",
    "The own checker preserves historical LSE qualification=false for LSI/cycle timing/PLL and raw electrical preprojection absence. It enforces complete54 input/file/name/line identities, one SYSCTRL clock owner, full exact2 LSI records, both Pin tuples and generic exclusion.",
    "The L010 checker is restricted to the approved sorted global roster insertion and retired cross-L012 exclusion. Own L010 facts remain unchanged. L011 checker and all three transport definitions remain byte-identical.",
    "Source registry contains exactly21 terminal evidence-reference appends, four originals and17 selected members. Removing only those entries reproduces baseline bytes exactly. The bound qualification remains pending implementation receipt assembly, with no fabricated review hash or execution claim."
  ],
